var mermaidRender=(a=>{let b=`dark`;if(a==b){initOptions={startOnLoad:!1,theme:b}}else{initOptions={startOnLoad:!1,theme:`neutral`}};for(let a=0;a<mmdElements.length;a++){delete mmdElements[a].dataset.processed;mmdElements[a].innerHTML=mmdHTML[a]};mermaid.initialize(initOptions);mermaid.run()});mmdElements=document.getElementsByClassName(`mermaid`);const mmdHTML=[];for(let a=0;a<mmdElements.length;a++){mmdHTML[a]=mmdElements[a].innerHTML}